type: software
title: "3D Chip Security Logic Lock: Multi-Step Physical Intercept & Audit"
abstract: >
  A novel 3D-stacked hardware security logic lock implementing five-axiom audit,
  nanosecond back-gate bias response, and permanent hard-wired shutdown.
  Five modules verified with Icarus Verilog 12.0 on EDA Playground (35 test cases, 100% pass).
